439 0 obj
<</P 191 0 R/S /Formula/Alt (\r\nLease Inception, Lessee\rThe lessee would recognize a right-of-use asset and lease liability at lease inception on 1/1/2019. The asset and liability are recorded at the present value of all future lease payments; i.e., $45,000.\r\rcap P cap V cap A. cap N cap N sub , 3,8% end subscript equals open bracket 1 minus open paren 1 plus 0.08 , close paren to the , minus 3 end superscript , close bracket over 0.08 equals 2.577\r\rSo, present value of three payments of $17,461.51 is $17,461.51 * 2.577 = $45,000.\r)/Type /StructElem/Pg 26 0 R/K 1>>
endobj
